Package: ukui-shell-integration
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Ukui Shell integration
 Ukui-shell-integration is a qtwayland plugin which can ensure your qt windows
 behaves identically on the UKUI platform as it does on Windows or X11.
